1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,477
The reorder we owe our supplier? Nobody's typing that email. You ask for it.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,600
Francis writes it and saves it as a draft — never sent. Every email he read is a chip. Tap the invoice, and you're in Mail, on the real thread.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,419
And in Drafts, the reorder is waiting — addressed, referenced, ready for your send button.

4
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,631
Mail — episode five of the Module Tours. Full tour on YouTube.
